  "id": "chocolate-orange-cupcakes",
  "name": "Chocolate Orange Cupcakes",
  "subtitle": "Cocoa cupcakes with orange frosting and chocolate accents",
  "description": "Moist chocolate cupcakes flavored with orange zest, finished with orange-tinted frosting and simple chocolate decoration.",
